WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.100
- So it was revealed in "Keeping
up with the Kardashians"

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.690
that Kim Kardashian did not in
fact pass the baby bar exam.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.730
I covered this story two years ago.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.150
Kim Kardashian is trying to
become a lawyer in California

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.530
through a little-used
apprenticeship program.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.620
She's not going to an
accredited law school,

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.810
she's trying to become a lawyer

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.170
by being an apprentice for other lawyers.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.500
And, as part of that process,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.020
you have to take the baby bar exam.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.490
This is a thing in California where,

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.140
if you don't go to an
accredited law school

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.780
or you're using this apprenticeship thing,

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.520
you have to take a test to make sure

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.830
that you are up to snuff
so that you can continue

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.610
and not waste everyone's time and money.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.420
She came relatively close,
but didn't actually pass,

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.290
and I applaud her for
putting in the hard work.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.080
It would be really easy
for a celebrity like her

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.630
to just completely phone it in.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.390
It seems like she's being genuine

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.540
and I imagine she could do a lot of good

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.680
for criminal justice reform

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.700
if she were able to pass the bar.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.410
So I'm rooting for Kim to
take the baby bar exam again

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.953
and continue in her studies.

